flowchart LR

CLI["`Client
React (Vite) · Postman
HttpOnly cookies + X-CSRF-Token`"]
TRF["`Traefik v3.3
:80 → :443 TLS · single entrypoint
X-Forwarded-For · dashboard off`"]

M1["`1 · SecurityHeaders
CSP · nosniff · frame DENY
HSTS in production`"]
M2["`2 · RequestLogging
one JSON line per request
user_id · latency · trace_id`"]
M3["`3 · Rate limit (slowapi)
120/min · auth 10 · expensive 20
counters in Redis`"]
M4["`4 · CSRF
double-submit cookie
unsafe methods only`"]
DISP["`APIRouter · prefix /api/v1
auth cookie required
(except login / register)`"]

A_AUTH["`auth · login refresh logout me
AuthService — Argon2id · JWT 15min/30d
rotating refresh + reuse detection`"]
A_CRUD["`domain CRUD (owner-scoped)
subjects · plans · modules
academic-items · categories · types
icons · colors · soft delete`"]
A_DOC["`documents · upload → 202
list · get · status · delete
UploadService — extension + MIME
+ real magic bytes · 100 MB → 413`"]
A_RAG["`rag · POST /rag/query
RetrievalService — embed → cosine top-k
ALWAYS scoped to owned content_ids`"]
A_AI["`ai · /ai/ask · /ai/health
PATCH /ai/providers/{name}
AiService — RAG context
+ prompt-injection delimiters`"]
A_GEN["`generation · POST /plans
GET /generations/{id}
GenerationService — planner + reviewer
plan (sync) → materialize → fan-out`"]
A_AUD["`audit · GET /audit-logs (admin)
AuditRecorder — row staged in the SAME
transaction as the business change`"]
A_OPS["`ops
/health · /ready · /metrics · /docs`"]

WRK["`Celery worker (same image as API)
task_acks_late · prefetch 1
retry 15s → 30s → 60s → FAILED`"]
P1["`documents.ingest ①
fetch object`"]
P2["`parse → Markdown
pdf · docx · pptx · xlsx · txt · md`"]
P3["`header-aware chunking
~1000 chars + overlap`"]
P4["`embed with bge-m3
1024 dimensions`"]
P5["`index in pgvector
status → INDEXED`"]
GENT["`generation.run_item — one per item
RAG context → LLM → content.markdown
run → RUNNING / COMPLETED / PARTIAL`"]
FLW["`Flower :5555
task / queue / failure monitor`"]

PG["`PostgreSQL 17 + pgvector
users · refresh_tokens · auth_logs
audit_logs · subjects · plans
modules · academic_items · categories
icons · colors · document
document_content · document_format
plan_generation · plan_document
ai_provider
chunks vector(1024) · HNSW cosine
SQLAlchemy 2.0 async · Alembic`"]
RDS["`Redis 8
db0 cache · db1 broker · db2 results
db3 rate limit · login lockout
embedding cache · circuit-breaker keys`"]
MIO["`MinIO — S3 compatible
bucket profplan
raw files: subject_id/uuid.ext`"]
OLL["`Ollama
bge-m3 embeddings (1024-d)
llama3.2:3b chat fallback`"]
ADM["`Adminer :8081
DB UI — dev profile only`"]

GW["`LLMGateway — one door for AI calls
semaphore LLM_MAX_CONCURRENCY = 5
skips providers disabled in DB
no DB connection held during the call`"]
CB["`CircuitBreaker — state in Redis
closed → open (3 fails)
→ half-open after 30s
shared by every API/worker replica`"]
PC["`1 · Anthropic Claude
claude-sonnet-5`"]
PO["`2 · OpenAI
gpt-4o`"]
PGM["`3 · Google Gemini
gemini-2.5-flash`"]
PL["`4 · Ollama (local)
llama3.2:3b · never disableable`"]

OTC["`OTel Collector
OTLP :4317 / :4318`"]
TMP["`Tempo
distributed traces`"]
PTL["`Promtail
docker socket discovery`"]
LOK["`Loki
log aggregation`"]
NEX["`node-exporter
host CPU / memory / disk`"]
PRM["`Prometheus :9090
scrapes /metrics`"]
GRF["`Grafana :3000
metrics + logs + traces
datasources provisioned`"]

LG1["`EDGE
client + reverse proxy`"]
LG2["`API
FastAPI · middleware + modules`"]
LG3["`ASYNC
Celery worker + tasks`"]
LG4["`DATA
Postgres · Redis · MinIO · Ollama`"]
LG5["`LLM
gateway + provider fallback chain`"]
LG6["`OBSERVABILITY
logs · metrics · traces`"]

CLI -->|"HTTPS"| TRF
TRF ==>|"Host: api.localhost"| M1
M1 --> M2 --> M3 --> M4 ==> DISP

DISP --> A_AUTH
DISP --> A_CRUD
DISP --> A_DOC
DISP --> A_RAG
DISP --> A_AI
DISP --> A_GEN
DISP --> A_AUD
DISP --> A_OPS

A_AUTH -->|"① users · refresh_tokens · auth_logs"| PG
A_AUTH -.->|"① login attempt counter"| RDS
A_CRUD -->|"② owner-scoped SQL"| PG
A_AUD  -->|"⑧ audit_logs in the same transaction"| PG

A_DOC  -->|"③ put_object"| MIO
A_DOC  -->|"③ document row = PENDING"| PG
A_DOC  -.->|"③ enqueue documents.ingest"| RDS
RDS    -.->|"③ ④ deliver task"| WRK
WRK --> P1 --> P2 --> P3 --> P4 --> P5
WRK --> GENT
P1     -->|"③ file bytes"| MIO
P4     -->|"③ /api/embeddings"| OLL
P4     -.->|"③ embedding cache"| RDS
P5     -->|"③ document_content + chunks"| PG

A_GEN  ==>|"④ planner: draft → eval → repair"| GW
A_GEN  -->|"④ run + modules + items (PENDING)"| PG
A_GEN  -.->|"④ fan-out: one task per item"| RDS
GENT   ==>|"④ generate item"| GW
GENT   -->|"④ item content + run status"| PG

A_RAG  -->|"⑤ embed question"| OLL
A_RAG  -->|"⑤ cosine top-k over chunks"| PG
A_AI   ==>|"⑥ answer grounded in context"| GW

GW --> CB
GW ==>|"try first"| PC
PC -.->|"fail · no key · circuit open"| PO
PO -.->|"fail"| PGM
PGM -.->|"fail"| PL
PL -.->|"all failed → 503"| GW
CB -.->|"⑥ breaker keys"| RDS

M2  -.->|"⑦ OTLP spans (OTEL_ENABLED)"| OTC
WRK -.->|"⑦ OTLP spans"| OTC
M2  -.->|"⑦ stdout JSON logs"| PTL
WRK -.->|"⑦ stdout JSON logs"| PTL
A_OPS -.->|"⑦ /metrics scrape"| PRM
OTC --> TMP --> GRF
PTL --> LOK --> GRF
NEX --> PRM --> GRF
FLW -.-> RDS
ADM -.-> PG

